           tronix-type terminal, use sseettaaff (set ANSI foreground) and sseettaabb
           (set ANSI background) or sseettff (set foreground) and sseettbb (set back‐
           ground).  These take one parameter, the color number.  The SVr4
           documentation describes only sseettaaff/sseettaabb; the XPG4 draft says that
           "If the terminal supports ANSI escape sequences to set background
           and foreground, they should be coded as sseettaaff and sseettaabb, respec‐
           tively.

