       terminal, such as _s_w_i_t_c_h, _d_i_a_l_u_p, _p_a_t_c_h, and _n_e_t_w_o_r_k, should include
       the ggnn (generic) capability so that programs can complain that they do
       not know how to talk to the terminal.  (This capability does not apply
       to _v_i_r_t_u_a_l terminal descriptions for which the escape sequences are
